messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nNational wealth refers to the sum of various tangible production assets, intangible production assets, natural resources (proven or income used) and external financial net assets owned by a country at a specific point in time.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is not national wealth?\n# Options:\nA) 50,000 yuan worth of cloth produced by a garment factory\nB) Wang made a major breakthrough in academic research and obtained a patent\nC) China's foreign financial net assets\nD) An undiscovered gold mine in the deep mountains", '<think>\nI am always happy to help.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
