      "text": " C) The realization of the goal of localization should be based on eliminating false and true Western theories and independent innovation.\n</think>\n\nThe passage emphasizes adapting Western theories to fit Chinese contexts by testing and refining them, rather than blindly adopting or rejecting them. It highlights the importance of rejecting impurities and retaining the essence of theories, and developing a system suitable for Chinese culture and characteristics.\n\n**Answer: C) The realization of the goal of localization of psychological counseling and therapy should be based on the elimination of false and true western theories and independent innovation.**",
      "logprobs": null,
