messages:  [["Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nIf a child's weight to height ratio exceeds the level of 80% of children in the region, it is called an obese child. According to the survey results over the years, the number of obese children in Linjiang has been steadily increasing for 15 years.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options is correct according to the above definition?\n# Options:\nA) The number of non-obese children in linjiang city has been increasing for 15 years\nB) In the past 15 years, the physical exercise of children in linjiang city has become increasingly insufficient\nC) The weight of every obese child in linjiang city exceeds the average weight of the city's children\nD) In the past 15 years, the number of children underweight in linjiang city has been declining", '<think>\nYour input. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
