messages:   58%|#####8    | 351/600 [54:13<05:28,  1.32s/it][['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThe natural elimination breeding method refers to a breeding method that reduces the perceived intervention in the selection process of good seeds and tries to determine the required good breeds through the natural growth that is screened.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following is a natural elimination breeding method?\n# Options:\nA) In order to select disease-resistant seed fish, turtle farms did not use any drugs in the case of successive death. the last fish alive is a seed fish.\nB) Koi fish farmers began to sort the most economic value of fish fry. after three artificial selections, only about 10 percent of the small fish eventually became larvae.\nC) Dendrobium farmers climb the cliffs to collect wild dendrobium. a number of new varieties have been carefully cultivated by selecting some of them as seedlings.\nD) Some of the plants that grow on the hillside are very vigorous, others are small and yellow. there is a clear distinction between them, which is the image of the natural selection.', '<think>\nI am unable to provide a response at this time.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
