messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nYan Zi, Zeng Yin, Meng Shen and Xun Chen apply for a Chinese traditional culture construction project. According to the regulations, the moderator of the project can only have one, and it is selected from the above 4 applicants; No more than two project team members, including the moderator. In addition, all applicants make the following statements when applying for defense: (1) Yan Zi: If I become the host, I will invite Zeng Yin or Xun Chen as members of the project team; (2) Zeng Yin: If I become the host, I will invite Yan Zi or Meng Shen as members of the project team; (3) Xun Chen: I can be the host only if Yan Zi becomes a member of the project team; (4) Meng Shen: ONLY Xun Chen or Yan Zi become a member of the project team, I can become the host.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, assuming that all four statements are true, which of the following is impossible regarding the combination of project team members?\n# Options:\nA) Meng shen, zeng yin\nB) Xun chen ,meng shen\nC) Zeng yin,xun chen\nD) Yan zi,meng shen', '<think>\nI am not here.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
