messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nContinuous contrast refers to the visual dislocation of color contrast observed and felt by the human eye in different time periods.Continuous comparison is divided into positive and negative images.Positive image refers to the visual state in which the image of the original object color is retained temporarily after the visual stimulation of the object is stopped.Negative image refers to the visual state in which the visual image is temporarily colored with the original object after the visual stimulation of the object is stopped.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following options is negative?\n# Options:\nA) A continuous projection of a static screen at 24 frames per second creates a dynamic picture in front of your eyes\nB) After staring at a red object, even if you move it away, you will still feel red appear in front of you\nC) After staring at red for a long time, the vision moves quickly to white, not white, but green\nD) Red is paired with yellow, and red is sometimes seen as a color with purple, and sometimes with yellow as a color with green', '<think>\nNothing.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
response:  {
  "id": "cmpl-3716e3f707b84fa4bd3cee28091cfaeb",
  "object": "text_completion",
  "created": 1754627854,
  "model": "DeepSeekR1-Qwen-7B",
  "choices": [
    {
