messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nThere are only liberal arts and science classes in a high school. There are more boys than girls, and more science classes than liberal arts classes.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, which of the following options must be correct based on the above conditions?\n# Options:\nA) The total number of boys in the liberal arts class is more than the total number of girls in the liberal arts class\nB) The total number of boys in the science class is more than the total number of girls in the science class\nC) The total number of boys in the liberal arts class is higher than that of girls in the science class\nD) The total number of boys in science class is more than that of girls in liberal arts class', '<think>\nNothing.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
