re admitted to peking university, tsinghua university and beijing normal university respectively.\n\nYes, that's exactly our conclusion.\n\nBut wait, the initial analysis thought that option D was correct, but that's not the case.\n\nWait, perhaps I made a mistake earlier.\n\nWait, let me check the options again.\n\nOption D: Zhao Ming Peking, Qian Hong Beijing Normal, Sun Jie Tsinghua.\n\nBut according to our deductions, Sun Jie is Beijing Normal, so option D is incorrect.\n\nWait, but according to the analysis, the correct assignment is Zhao Ming Peking, Qian Hong Tsinghua, Sun Jie Beijing Normal, which is option A.\n\nBut let me check the options again.\n\nWait, the options are:\n\nA) Zhao Ming: Peking, Qian Hong: Tsinghua, Sun Jie: Beijing Normal.\n\nB) Zhao Ming: Tsinghua, Qian Hong: Beijing Normal, Sun Jie: Peking.\n\nC) Zhao Ming: Beijing Normal, Qian Hong: Tsinghua, Sun Jie: Peking.\n\nD) Zhao Ming: Peking, Qian Hong: Beijing Normal, Sun Jie: Tsinghua.\n\nSo, according to our deductions, the correct answer is option A.\n\nBut wait, let me check if this satisfies the condition that each classmate's guesses are half right.\n\nLet's check each classmate's guesses.\n\nClassmate A: Zhao Ming Tsinghua? No. Sun Jie Beijing Normal? Yes. So one correct, one wrong. Good.\n\nClassmate B: Zhao Ming Beijing Normal? No. Qian Hong Tsinghua? Yes. So one correct, one wrong. Good.\n\nClassmate C: Zhao Ming Peking? Yes. Sun Jie Tsinghua? No. So one correct, one wrong. Good.\n\nSo, all three classmates have exactly one correct guess each. So option A is correct.\n\nBut wait, the initial analysis thought that option D was correct, but that's not the case. So the correct answer is option A.\n\nWait, but in the initial analysis, I thought that option D was correct, but that was a mistake. So the correct answer is option A.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is A.\n\nStep-by-step explanation:\n\n1. **Classmate A's guesses:**\n   - Zhao Ming \u2192 Tsinghua (wrong)\n   - Sun Jie \u2192 Beijing Normal (correct)\n\n2. **Classmate B's guesses:**\n   - Zhao Ming \u2192 Beijing Normal (wrong)\n   - Qian Hong \u2192 Tsinghua (correct)\n\n3. **Classmate C's guesses:**\n   - Zhao Ming \u2192 Peking (correct)\n   - Sun Jie \u2192 Tsinghua (wrong)\n\nFrom these, we deduce:\n- Zhao Ming is Peking.\n- Qian Hong is Tsinghua.\n- Sun Jie is Beijing Normal.\n\nThis matches option A.\n\n**Answer: A**",
