directly related to reusing classrooms.\n   - **C**: Relates to increased families with children in colleges, but since enrollment is decreasing, it doesn't directly support the plan.\n   - **D**: Indicates many classrooms are rarely used, supporting the plan by providing available resources.\n\n3. **Conclusion**: Option D best supports the plan by highlighting the availability of classrooms.\n\nAnswer: D",
