st be hot. But the statement says that in most parts, cyclamen can grow, so this would be false.\n\n**Conclusion:**\nOption D must be false because the statement implies that cyclamen can grow in most parts, making it impossible to grow everywhere.\n\n**Final Answer:**\n\\boxed{D}",
