messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B, C or D.\n####\n# Context:\nProduct positioning refers to the determination of product (or service) functions, quality, price, packaging, sales channels, service methods, etc., in order to meet the target market.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, according to the above definition, which of the following is not product positioning?\n# Options:\nA) Our products will serve students in school\nB) Considering the income of consumers, our products will be priced around 1000 yuan\nC) Our service will be mainly through home maintenance to achieve\nD) Our service will let you have beautiful enjoyment', '<think>\nI have never been to that restaurant before.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
